Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Requests</> tab, you can manage friend request information. \n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Recommendations: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add</> tab, the system automatically recommends friends from the current server.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Pop-up Settings: </><Assistant_System>In Settings - Social - Information Settings</>, you can manage whether to display friend request pop-ups.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete and Block]|1412}",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>一份觉醒契约已送达——来自诡秘的绑定请求。</>\n请点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">确认绑定</>完成契约签署。\n 若非本人操作，请忽略此邮件。\n感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>An Awakening Contract has arrived—a binding request from the Lord of Mysteries. </>\nPlease click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Confirm Binding</> to complete the contract signing. \n If this was not performed by you, please ignore this email. \nThank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward.",
